'''Fencer Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]] increases his health and attack power marginally, as well as greatly shortening his attack animation and increasing his attack rate. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]].

