==Trivia==
*Fencer Cat is in an "[[wikipedia:Fencing practice and techniques|en-garde stance]]", and Kendo Cat is in the "[[wikipedia:Chūdan-no-kamae|Chūdan-no-kamae]]" stance.
*The Kitty of Liberty is a direct reference to the [[wikipedia:Statue of Liberty|Statue of Liberty]].
*He uses his right hand to hold his weapon in battle, while his cat unit icon has him using his left hand to hold his weapon. This is due to how Cats have mirrored icons that face to the right, instead of to the left like battle animations.
*The sprites for Fencer Cat's [[wikipedia:Body cord|body cord]] and scoring machine are still present in Kendo Cat's spritesheet, but can't be seen in his animations.
*When Fencer Cat and Kendo Cat attack, they generate a motion blur effect. This effect still exists in The Kitty of Liberty's spritesheet, but goes unused.

